.Dd June 23, 2026
.Dt CC-BURN-WATCH 8
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm cc-burn-watch
.Nd periodic Claude Code burn-rate alerter
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Cm run | install | uninstall | status
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a LaunchAgent that reads
.Xr cc-burn 1
.Fl -json
on an interval and fires a macOS notification when the 5h-window severity
.Sy worsens
(ok \(-> warn \(-> alert). Only transitions notify \(em no spam while you sit at
the same level. It also caches a compact line and the full JSON the zdots.local
console and status line read, so neither pays
.Xr ccusage 1 Ns 's
per-render cost.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width uninstall
.It Cm run
One check plus notify-on-transition (what launchd invokes).
.It Cm install
Write and load the LaunchAgent.
.It Cm uninstall
Unload and remove it.
.It Cm status
Report whether the agent is loaded and the last severity.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_CC_WATCH_INTERVAL
.It Ev ZDOTS_CC_WATCH_INTERVAL
Seconds between checks (default 300).
.El
Plus the
.Xr cc-burn 1
ceiling and threshold knobs.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr cc-burn 1
